{"tmdb":1695893,"tagline":"Who was that anger for?","synopsis":"After the collapse of the Destiny Plan proposed by Dullindal, Cagalli has been working to bring about a peaceful new order by establishing a global peace monitoring agency called COMPS (pronounced \"Compass\"). In C.E.74, the great war is over but Shinn has yet to decide what course he should follow. When a mobile suit that survived many past battlefields is stolen from COMPS's temporary base on Onogoro Island, Shinn and his comrades once again throw themselves into battle.","directors":[{"name":"Mitsuo Fukuda","id":1241824}],"cast":[{"actor":"Kenichi Suzumura","role":"Shinn Asuka (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vFqjmIjxfgBkh3ZmUin7QETV0sy.jpg","tmdb":9726},{"actor":"Maaya Sakamoto","role":"Lunamaria Hawke (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jcjTJbxN3rYOtjSJihvbygvEFFZ.jpg","tmdb":9711},{"actor":"Houko Kuwashima","role":"Agnes Giebenrath (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uZSmoh5jSdLwmkLaCnC3Xju6TTN.jpg","tmdb":220710},{"actor":"Daisuke Ono","role":"Leonard Valway (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5rjl28lx84JjRS0hzq3Ajvx2dhp.jpg","tmdb":1241498},{"actor":"Soichiro Hoshi","role":"Kira Yamato (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kBULhALfWrkacAuX9KZHBx27nfJ.jpg","tmdb":89879},{"actor":"Rie Tanaka","role":"Lacus Clyne (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wBWsjzwpFovyHDv027zU0oZyWHd.jpg","tmdb":89883},{"actor":"Akira Ishida","role":"Athrun Zala (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jnW2Gn2NlR2uwOCeyOuzypnTmkH.jpg","tmdb":81244},{"actor":"Nanako Mori","role":"Cagalli Yula Athha (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pWnGeuTEA4OUA8lcpl6yWVsC5tg.jpg","tmdb":1792563},{"actor":"Tomokazu Seki","role":"Yzak Jule (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jGQC9KkfNMh2wBgizw81GLX2KN2.jpg","tmdb":90567},{"actor":"Akira Sasanuma","role":"Dearka Elthman (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/